      "role": "user",
      "content": "integrity doesnt pay the rent or bring back my friends. people i've known for a decade won't even look me in the eye. it's just... exhausting to keep trying to rebuild something when the foundation is completely gone. i look at my life and i just see a void. it feels like i'm already a ghost walking around.",
